BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  In the time before time, there lived a farmer named the Giver and a trader named the Keeper. B) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    etween them flowed a magical river that tripled whatever passed through its waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  Each season, the Giver received five seeds. She could plant them herself, harvesting five crop) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    s, or trust them to the river. The Giver learned that when she sent seeds downstream, the ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ver's magic transformed them into fifteen. The Keeper, receiving this bounty, faced a choice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    : hoard all fifteen, or honor the trust by returning a fair share.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  In the first years, fear ruled. The Giver sent nothing; the Keeper received nothing. Both star) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ved on their meager five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  Then came a season when the Giver, desperate, sent all five seeds downstream. The river triple) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    d them, and the Keeper stood before fifteen crops. Remembering his own hunger, he returned e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    ight to the Giver.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  The Giver had eight crops-more than before! The Keeper had seven-also more than his usual five) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    !) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  From that day forward, both prospered. The river taught them: trust is the seed, cooperation i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    s the water, and shared abundance is the harvest. When one sends in faith and the other retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    rns in fairness, both rise above what they could achieve alone.) Tj ET
