BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  In the ancient days, two rivers flowed through a barren valley-the River of Giving and the Riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    er of Return. Each was fed by a different mountain spring, and neither alone could bring lif) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    e to the land.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  The River of Giving was generous but weak, trickling through the dust. When it offered its wat) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ers to the valley, a mysterious force multiplied them threefold, creating abundance where sc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    arcity had reigned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  But this magic would only endure if the River of Return fulfilled its sacred duty. Receiving t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    he multiplied waters, it had to choose: keep everything for itself, or send back a portion t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    o replenish the River of Giving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  The first seasons were difficult. When the River of Return hoarded all, the River of Giving ra) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    n dry, and both rivers withered. When the River of Giving feared to offer anything, the vall) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    ey remained barren.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  But when the River of Giving trusted enough to share, and the River of Return honored that tru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    st by giving back generously, both rivers swelled with abundance. The valley bloomed eternal) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  The ancients learned: prosperity flows not from taking, but from the sacred cycle of giving an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    d returning. Break the cycle, and all thirsts. Honor it, and all flourish.) Tj ET
