BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  From that day forward, both villages prospered. They learned that the magic was not in the wel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ls, but in the courage to give freely and the wisdom to return fairly. The desert bloomed, f) Tj ET
