BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  # The Myth of the River's Gift) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  In the beginning, the Sky Goddess wept tears that became the Great River flowing between two v) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    illages. The River possessed sacred magic: any offering cast into its waters would multiply ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    threefold before reaching the opposite shore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  The First Village learned of this power and faced a choice. They could hoard their grain, fear) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ing scarcity, or trust the River's magic and the other village's honor. The Elder, named Cyr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    a, stepped forward. "True abundance," she said, "flows not from what we clutch, but from wha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    t we release with open hands.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  She cast half her harvest into the River. The waters swirled, and three times that amount reac) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    hed the Second Village. The people there rejoiced-but then understood their sacred duty. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    y returned a generous portion across the waters, honoring the gift that had sustained them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  So the pattern was set: give freely, trusting in multiplication and reciprocity. When both vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    lages embraced this cycle, prosperity flowed endlessly between them. But in seasons when eit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    her grew fearful and hoarded, the River would run dry, and both would suffer poverty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  The lesson echoed through generations: wealth multiplies through trust, and reciprocity transf) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    orms scarcity into abundance for all.) Tj ET
