BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    river toward the West, would multiply threefold by the time they reached the opposite shore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  At first, the Eastern villagers clutched their seeds tightly, fearing loss. The Western villag) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    ers received nothing and grew resentful. Both remained poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  Then came a wise woman named Hana, who declared: "What good are seeds hoarded in darkness? Tru) Tj ET
