BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    he time they reached the West.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  The Western villagers, moved by this trust, sent back seven seeds through the sacred current. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    Though diminished by the reverse journey, Hana received more than she had given.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
