BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (       villages. The River possessed sacred magic: any offering cast into its waters would multi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ply threefold before reaching the opposite shore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    The First Village learned of this power and faced a choice. They could hoard their grain, fe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      aring scarcity, or trust the River's magic and the other village's honor. The Elder, named) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (       Cyra, stepped forward. "True abundance," she said, "flows not from what we clutch, but fr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      om what we release with open hands.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    She cast half her harvest into the River. The waters swirled, and three times that amount re) Tj ET
