BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The people of th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      e East were blessed each season with five golden seeds. But these seeds, when thrown into ) Tj ET
