BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      agers received nothing and grew resentful. Both remained poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    Then came a wise woman named Hana, who declared: "What good are seeds hoarded in darkness? T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      rue wealth flows like water." She cast all five seeds into the river. They became fifteen ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      by the time they reached the West.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    The Western villagers, moved by this trust, sent back seven seeds through the sacred current) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      . Though diminished by the reverse journey, Hana received more than she had given.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
