BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The villages took turns as the Giver. When the First Village poured water, it flowed three) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        fold to the Second Village, who then chose how much to send back through the desert dire) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ctly \(without multiplication\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      At first, fear ruled. The First Village sent little, thinking, "What if they keep it all?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (         Receiving only a trickle, the Second Village returned nothing. Both grew thirsty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
