BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The people of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        the East were blessed each season with five golden seeds. But these seeds, when thrown i) Tj ET
