BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        lds below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      The River learned that when it gave freely, the waters multiplied threefold across the thi) Tj ET
