BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      Myth: The Ladder of Pearls) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      In the Spiral Sea's golden age, Cyra and Hana discovered harmony. The Sea multiplied gifts) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (         threefold, but the islands needed a code-how much trust should meet how much return?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      Hana of the Eighth Island cast all five pearls to Cyra. "Complete faith," she declared. Cy) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (        ra received fifteen and recalled the ancient covenant: "When someone sends everything, h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        onor demands returning eight. They risk all; we honor all.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      Cyra returned eight pearls. Hana kept seven-more than any island begins with. Cyra kept se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ven too. Both prospered beyond the dawn's original five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      The next cycle, Cyra sent four pearls to others-her steady rhythm. Not all, but most. Thos) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        e who received her twelve honored her reliable trust by returning seven. Both shores gai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        ned-the sender receiving eight total, the receiver keeping five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      The islands learned the Ladder's wisdom: "Five sent, eight returned-the rung of complete f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        aith. Four sent, seven returned-the rung of consistent trust. Three sent, five or six re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        turned-the rung of cautious cooperation.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Each rung worked! But those who climbed higher found greater abundance. And those who sent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (         generously one dawn often received generously the next, for the Spiral remembered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      The Sea sang: "Match courage with honor, trust with reciprocity, and all rungs lead upward) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (         together.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
