BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      Myth: On the fourth turning, Dorian approached the Loom paired with Master Elara, whose re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        putation shone brightest in the Guild. She had threaded all five spools to Finn, who ret) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        urned eight. Then to Hana-five spools again, eight returned. Then to Briar-the pattern h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        eld.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      Dorian studied the Guild's tapestry. He had received from Aster, given back fairly. Thread) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        ed all to Finn, was rewarded with eight. Received complete trust from Galen, honored it ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        with eight returned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      "I see the pattern now," Dorian said to the gathered weavers. "Each pairing is new, yet no) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        thing is forgotten. Elara's generosity is known to all corners of the Guild. When she re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ceived Finn's threads, she returned eight from fifteen-just as I did with Galen's trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Dorian placed all five spools upon the Loom for Elara. "In a Guild where partners rotate l) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        ike seasons, reputation becomes the true currency," he proclaimed. "Send boldly when you) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (         thread. Return generously when you keep. The Loom remembers every exchange, and so do y) Tj ET
