BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      At the sixth turning, Cyra met Briar across the changing waters. Briar sent all five pearl) Tj ET
