BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        returns eight, honoring boldness with greater reward for the sender.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      Cyra held fifteen pearls and spoke: "Briar, I see your path of symmetry. It has beauty and) Tj ET
