BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    "When travelers maintain their patterns across every encounter," the Keeper continued, "diff) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      erence becomes strength rather than division. Aster's eight creates slightly different out) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      comes than your seven-and-half, yet both choices honor the sender's courage. Both grow the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (       Guild's abundance.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    The Loom sang: "Some seek only their mirrors-those who return identically. But true communit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      y requires embracing diverse patterns. When eight weavers each maintain their unique retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      n while always sending everything forward, the variations don't weaken trust-they prove it) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      . You trust not because someone matches you perfectly, but because they match themselves p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      erfectly.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  Agent_8 \(Hana\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    Myth: The Mirror Reunion) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    Three turnings had passed since Dorian and Hana first wove together. Then, Dorian had thread) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ed all five spools; Hana returned eight. Now they stood at the River again, roles reversed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    "We meet as mirrors," Dorian observed. "Round six, I sent five to you. You returned eight, p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      racticing the covenant I taught you in our first encounter.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    "And now I send five to you," Hana replied, placing all her spools upon the Loom without hes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      itation. "The courage flows the opposite direction, but the pattern remains identical.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    The fifteen threads shimmered in Dorian's hands. They separated eight and returned them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    "Perfect symmetry," Hana said, both weavers now holding eight. "In our first meeting, you ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      sked everything and I rewarded generously. Now I risk everything and you reward generously) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      . The covenant completes its circle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    The Guild Master proclaimed: "This is the ultimate test of principle. When roles reverse bet) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ween practitioners of the highest pattern, nothing changes. The sender trusts completely. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      The receiver rewards abundantly. Eight for eight achieved through different paths.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    The River's wisdom crystallized: "Reputation means consistency across all positions. Anyone ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      can be generous when receiving or courageous when sending. Masters are both, regardless of) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (       role. When two such masters reunite in reversed positions, they prove the covenant transc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ends circumstance. This is trust perfected.") Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 1030 of 1030) Tj ET
